before:
Complete local PHP example; the app itself does not execute it:
```php
<?php
declare(strict_types=1);
spl_autoload_register(function (string $class): void {
    if ($class === 'Topic') { require __DIR__ . '/Topic.php'; }
});
echo (new Topic())->label(), "\n";
```

